  "img": "systems/pf1/icons/skills/psychic_01.jpg",
  "name": "Psychic",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The psychic class stands apart from traditional spellcasters, drawing not from materia or mystic incantations, but from the raw, untapped power of their own mind. These masters of mental energy manifest their abilities through sheer willpower, allowing them to manipulate the environment with telekinesis, probe and influence the thoughts of others with telepathy and empathy, or even glimpse the future through precognition. Their discipline grants them control over the battlefield, bending the will of foes and bolstering the resolve of allies. Unlike mages who rely on MP, psychics typically utilize a pool of 'Phrenic Points' (PP), allowing for flexible expenditure of their mental energies, often with more subtle but equally potent effects.</em></p><h2>Role</h2><p>The psychic carves out a distinct and multifaceted niche within a party, primarily excelling as a controller and debuffer on the battlefield. Their psionic abilities allow them to manipulate enemy minds, inducing fear, confusion, or paralysis, effectively taking threats out of the fight or weakening them for allies. Beyond direct conflict, the psychic is an invaluable utility and information gatherer; clairvoyance grants them insight into hidden dangers or distant locations, while telepathy enables silent communication or the extraction of vital information directly from a target's thoughts. In social encounters, their capacity for empathy or subtle mental influence makes them adept negotiators or intimidators, capable of swaying opinions or uncovering deception where others might fail. They aren't typically front-line damage dealers or dedicated healers, but their strength lies in their versatility and unique problem-solving capabilities, ensuring the party approaches challenges with a strategic, often unconventional, edge, offering mental might where physical strength or traditional magic falls short.</p><h2>Class Skills</h2><p>The psychic's class skills are Appraise (Int), Bluff (Cha), Craft (Int), Diplomacy (Cha), Intimidate (Cha), Knowledge (all) (Int), Linguistics (Int), Perception (Wis), Perform (Cha), Profession (Wis), Sense Motive (Wis), Spellcraft (Int), and Use Magic Device (Cha).</p><h2>Weapon and Armor Proficiency</h2><p>A psychic is proficient with all simple weapons and power weapons (a psychic doesn't need MP to activate a power weapon and uses her psychic level to count for her caster level for feats). A psychic is proficient with light armor but not with any shields.</p><h2>Main Ability Score</h2><p>The psychic mainly focuses on INT for her class features and mental abilities.</p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
